  <documents xsi:type="kernel:StructuredDocument" id="ed42a334-67d9-5222-a392-c377a9fba418" name="Developer completion and demo boundary" format="MARKDOWN" content="Read a scoped member cache with 60-second TTL intent; implement invalidation and miss handling manually.&#10;Register once per subject; request-key replay returns the original identity.&#10;Members edit only their own permitted fields; staff own branch/status changes.&#10;Commit expected-version mutation, uniqueness marker, request key and history atomically; page at most 25 results.&#10;Generated function shells require real Go application code. Review endpoint reachability, resource permissions, contracts and naming before deployment." description="Reviewed demonstration model; not a deployment/acceptance certificate" />
